<title>CANADA: Scott's Restaurants Inc Q1 turns to profit.</title>
<headline>Scott's Restaurants Inc Q1 turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 ended March 29</p>
<p>	    1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.01     loss	C$0.02</p>
<p> Net	 profit	   200     loss	   600</p>
<p> Revs			75,600		   77,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Scott's Restaurants, which split from Scott's Hospitality and became public in September 1996, compared its first quarter to restated numbers previously included in information released by its former parent company. Last year's quarter ended March 23, 1996.</p>
<p>Scott's Restaurants completed a 22-week stub year ended December 28, 1996 to switch to a calendar fiscal year.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8109))</p>
</text>
